ScriptsforCastillaIbeasetal2026

figures_and_source_data.R is the R script used to produce all figures and source data. 

In this script, some chunks are run on Linux command line and are only for informative purposes since the input files are too big

To reproduce the figures generated on Linux command line, as well as scRNA-seq analysis, one would need to download fastq files from GEO and generate the input files from scratch

For any request or question e-mail alejandrocastillaibeas@gmail.com
